 README.md

# Agentic AI RAG Chatbot

 A document-grounded Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) chatbot built using Python, LangGraph, Pinecone, OpenAI embeddings, and FastAPI.

 The chatbot answers questions strictly using information retrieved from the provided Agentic AI eBook.

 ## 1\. Project Objective

 The objective of this project is to build a production-style RAG pipeline that:

 - Loads the Agentic AI eBook PDF.
- Splits the document into overlapping text chunks.
- Generates vector embeddings using OpenAI.
- Stores embeddings in Pinecone.
- Retrieves relevant document chunks for a user question.
- Uses LangGraph to orchestrate the RAG workflow.
- Generates answers using only retrieved document context.
- Validates whether the generated response is grounded.
- Returns the final answer, retrieved context, source pages, and confidence indicator through a FastAPI endpoint.

 ## 2\. Architecture

```
                    Agentic AI PDF
                          |
                          v
                    PDF Loader
                          |
                          v
                    Text Splitter
                          |
                          v
                 OpenAI Embeddings
                          |
                          v
                      Pinecone
                          |
                          |
                    User Question
                          |
                          v
                     LangGraph
                          |
                          v
                      Retrieve
                          |
                          v
                    Generate
                          |
                          v
                  Grounding Check
                          |
                          v
                       FastAPI
                          |
                          v
          Answer + Context + Confidence
```

 ## 3\. Technology Stack

 | Component | Technology |
| --- | --- |
| Language | Python 3.10+ |
| PDF Processing | PyPDF |
| Text Splitting | LangChain RecursiveCharacterTextSplitter |
| Embeddings | OpenAI text-embedding-3-small |
| Vector Database | Pinecone |
| Workflow | LangGraph |
| LLM | OpenAI GPT-4o-mini |
| API | FastAPI |
| Testing | Pytest |

